# Site content patterns

## Hours and location notices

| Surface | File | Notes |
|---------|------|-------|
| Store hours | `app/components/Footer.tsx` | Regular weekly hours; optional seasonal callout column |
| Site-wide closing / promo banner | `app/components/LocationClosingBanner.tsx` | Rendered in `app/layout.tsx` above Header |
| Party booking CTA | Banner + footer links to `/party` when requested |

Use consistent date formatting: **Sunday, August 23, 2026** or **4:00 PM - 9:00 PM** (match existing footer style).

## Events

- Featured event cards and Facebook embeds: `app/events/page.tsx`
- Remove expired events when dates pass; keep intro + social links + `ContactSection` as baseline
- Convert Facebook iframe HTML to valid JSX (`frameBorder`, `allowFullScreen`, `style` object)

## Games

- Arcade, pinball, and redemption lists: `app/games/page.tsx`
- Pinball entries are name-only in the list UI; add to `pinballGames` array and sort alphabetically
- Images use CDN via `getImageUrl()` and `ImagePaths` — follow existing entries

## Footer seasonal callouts

Reuse the bordered column pattern next to Store Hours (`md:border-l md:pl-6 md:border-border`):
- Title in `text-primary`
- Optional date/time line
- Link to `/events` or `/party` with `Link` from `next/link`

Remove callouts when the user says the event is over.
